        <mxCell id="note_0" value="Public preview: no authentication or database write.&lt;br&gt;PromotionService.preview/resolve logic is folded in.&lt;br&gt;applicability is PromotionRule.applicability;&lt;br&gt;discountFor is PricingRule.discountFor.&lt;br&gt;These helpers are not additional HTTP handlers.&lt;br&gt;Validity uses booking time, not the stay dates.&lt;br&gt;Booking creation rechecks and reprices the code&lt;br&gt;(UC-G07)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280.025" y="494.0508" width="366" height="126" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
